  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">뉴스에 따르면 초중고 교사 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >40%</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">가 우울증을 경험하였다지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >? </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">일시적으로 우울한 증세가 있다면 우리 반 아이들을 만나러 오실 것을 권해드려요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >.^^ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">우울까지는 아니더라도 봄철에 입맛이 없으신 분들도 환영합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span></p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">입학식 날 교실 복도에서부터 단체로 운동장을 가로질러 대강당으로 이동하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">제가 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">오리</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >~’ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">하니까 일제히 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">꽥꽥</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >’ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">하고 외치더군요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">이어서 진풍경이 펼쳐졌습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. ‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">참새</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >’ ‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">짹짹</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >’ ‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">강아지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >’ ‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">멍멍</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >’(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">작년 아이들은 서너 명만 따라했어요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >.) </span></p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">입학식 다음 날 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">무궁화 꽃이 피었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >.’ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">복도에서 이렇게 놀고 있었어요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">무궁화 꽃도 피었겠지만 지들의 얼굴 표정은 더욱 활짝 핀 채로요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span></p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">사람의 성격에는 내성적이고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">외향적인 성격이 있다지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">우리 반에는 외향적인 성격만 모였을 거라고 교과 샘들이 일치되는 의견을 보였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">종례 후에 집으로 돌아갈 때면 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">안녕히 계세요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >.’ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">라고 꼭 개별 인사를 해요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">학생들과 눈높이를 맞추라고 하잖아요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">아이들이 제 눈을 바라보며 인사를 하므로 저는 자동으로 해결된 셈입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span></p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">학기 초에 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">시간 지키기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >’ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">습관을 강도 높게 진행하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">한 녀석이 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >2</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">분 늦게 도착하였는데</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">제가 언성을 높이자 입을 비쭉이더니 닭똥 같은 눈물이 뚝뚝 떨어졌습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">우리 반 교실 바로 옆이 진로 상담실</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >). ‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">뭘 잘 했다고 우느냐</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >?’</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">고 하고선 교실로 돌려보냈습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">신입생에게 심하게 했다는 생각이 들어 마음에 걸렸는데</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >, 2</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">교시 후 복도에서 그 녀석을 만났습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">저를 보자 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">방긋방긋</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">방실방실</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >’ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">해맑은 표정으로 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">안녕하세요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >?’(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">우리 학교는 여중입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >.)    </span></p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">진단평가 과학문제가 어려웠나 봐요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">수업을 해 보니까 학업 면은 작년 아이들보다 다소 부족해요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">혹시 부진아에 걸리면 어쩌나&nbsp;염려하더니, 불이 나면 소화기의 안전핀을 먼저 뽑고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">뽑은 채</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">화재현장으로 달려가야 신속히 불을 끌 수 있다고 우기기 시작하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">온 몸으로 시연까지 보이면서요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">어찌나 리얼하게 표현하던지 소화기 사용 순서를 바꾸어야하지 않을까</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">…… </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">싶었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >.</span></p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">작년 아이들은 높은 도덕성에 빛나는</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">게다가 집중력이 뛰어난 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">똑똑이</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >’</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">들이었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">체육대회 때 마치 정교한 기계가 움직이는듯한 모습</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">어떤 선생님들은 톱니바퀴가 돌아가는 줄 알았다고 표현</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">을 보여주었지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">지들끼리 호흡이 척척 맞아 종목마다 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">등이었어요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">근데 잔정이 없어 섭섭할 때가</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">…… </span></p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">올해 아이들은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >3</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">월 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">무슨 데이</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >’</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">에 사탕 한 알씩을 제 손에 꼭 쥐어주었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. ‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">비글샘</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >~(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">제별명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >)’ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">저 멀리서 담임이 보이면</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">오랜 전에 헤어진 혈육을 만난 듯 살갑게 다가옵니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">사실 나이 때문에 담임을 계속해도 되는지 생각이 많았더랬습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">울 반 아이들이 나이 많은 저를 거부하지 않으니 고마울 따름입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. </span></p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">비뚤어지고 말테다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >.’ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">결심한 것처럼 삐딱선을 탄 아이가 있지만 친구들이 한없이 사랑스러우니 언젠가는 닮아가겠지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >? </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">통신기기팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">학습팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">환경팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">행사팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">경청팀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >. 3</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">월 말인 지금까지도 자신이 학급자치회의 어느 팀에 들어갈지 논쟁을 벌이고 있는데</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">이 문제 역시 언젠가는 자연스레 해결되어 있겠지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >?  </span></p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\">  &nbsp;  </p><p style=\"text-autospace: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M;\">선생님들의 학급 이야기도 듣고 싶습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 솔잎 M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\" >.   </span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
